    [3511]={name="Cloak of the People's Militia",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Red Leather Bandanas'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Scout Galiaan in Westfall. Objective: Bring 15 Red Leather Bandanas to Scout Galiaan at Sentinel Hill.",zone="Westfall",questName="Red Leather Bandanas",lore="The Defias Front is constantly shifting. I've been following their movements for quite some time now. On a side note, I've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the Red Leather Bandanas they wear."},
    [3559]={name="Night Watch Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=21,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Eight-Legged Menaces'. Starts with Watcher Dodds in Duskwood. Objective: Kill 15 Pygmy Venom Web Spiders, and then report back to Watcher Dodds in Duskwood.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Eight-Legged Menaces",lore="Hail. Perhaps you've seen those spiders that have taken over the western border? The eight-legged menaces are too much for us to handle, and the Commander hasn't enough manpower to spare so far from Darkshire."},
    [3560]={name="Mantle of Honor",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bride of the Embalmer'. Starts with Lord Ello Ebonlocke in Duskwood. Objective: Find Eliza's grave. Retrieve the Embalmer's Heart from her, then return to Ello Ebonlocke.",zone="Duskwood",questName="Bride of the Embalmer",lore="The Embalmer is a name told in one of our children's stories. He was a kindly alchemist, driven mad by the death of his wife, Eliza. To restore her, he used dark magic to place his own heart within the bosom of his dead spouse."},
    [3561]={name="Resilient Poncho",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Apprentice's Duties'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with James Halloran in Wetlands. Objective: Collect 6 Giant Crocolisk Skins and bring them to James Halloran in Menethil Harbor.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Apprentice's Duties",lore="I sent my apprentice out into the marshes to skin some of our famous giant Wetlands crocolisks. When he didn't return, I went out to look for him..."},
    [3562]={name="Belt of Vindication",quality=3,ilvl=29,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fury Runs Deep'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Motley Garmason in Wetlands. Objective: Motley Garmason wants Kam Deepfury's head brought to him at Dun Modr.",zone="The Stockade",questName="The Fury Runs Deep",lore="You have proven your loyalty to King Magni. And your hatred for the Dark Iron scum is as great as my own. There is a task I wish to complete myself but I am bound by honor to stay with Longbraid."},
    [3563]={name="Seafarer's Pantaloons",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Large Loch Crocolisk.",zone="Loch Modan",npc="Large Loch Crocolisk"},
    [3566]={name="Raptorbane Armor",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ormer's Revenge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ormer Ironbraid in Wetlands. Objective: Ormer Ironbraid at the Whelgar Excavation Site wants you to kill Sarltooth and return to him with one of his talons once the task is fulfilled.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Ormer's Revenge",lore="While you were down there I happened to notice that one of those beasts stood out from the rest. He was bigger and more menacing. I bet he's the one who led the others here to cause the disruption to the dig site."},
    [3570]={name="Bonegrinding Pestle",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arugal's Folly'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dalar Dawnweaver in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 Worgen Bits to Dalar Dawnweaver in The Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
    [3571]={name="Trogg Beater",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="rare_npc",instructions="Drops from Magosh.",zone="Loch Modan",npc="Magosh"},
    [3572]={name="Daryl's Shortsword",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hunter's Challenge'. Starts with Daryl the Youngling in Loch Modan. Objective: Kill 5 Elder Mountain Boars and return to Daryl the Youngling in the Farstrider Lodge within 12 minutes.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="A Hunter's Challenge",lore="ath, is it? I can tell you're bursting with pride over completing the first test, hm? As I told you before, it's no large feat. You should try your hand at boar hunting."},
    [3578]={name="Harvester's Pants",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Killing Fields'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Farmer Saldean in Westfall. Objective: Farmer Saldean wants you to kill 20 Harvest Watchers.",zone="Westfall",questName="The Killing Fields",lore="Look at what has happened to this place! These lands were once occupied by good farm folk. But the damned thieves have driven them all off. Not me, though!"},
    [3582]={name="Acidproof Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Recipe For Death'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Renferrel in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 samples of Lake Creeper Moss, 6 samples of Lake Skulker Moss and a Hardened Tumor to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="A Recipe For Death",lore="According to Berard's Journal the moss from Lake Skulkers and Creepers might prove useful for our quest to brew a new plague. Those beasts dwell on the islands in Lake Lordamere to the east."},
    [3585]={name="Camouflaged Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Weaver'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shadow Priest Allister in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Kill the Dalaran archmage, then retrieve his staff for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="The Weaver",lore="An archmage of great power is overseeing the reactivation of the ley energy node. With the progress they have made, our only hope of stopping them is by killing him."},
    [3586]={name="Logsplitter",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arugal's Folly'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dalar Dawnweaver in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Bring 6 Worgen Bits to Dalar Dawnweaver in The Sepulcher.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
