    [14551]={name="Edgemaster's Handguards",quality=4,ilvl=49,reqLevel=44,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 44-52.",lore="Famous long before anyone worked out why. In Classic these carried +7 to axes, daggers and swords, and weapon skill quietly cut miss, dodge and parry AND the glancing-blow penalty -- worth around 10% more damage to a dual-wielding warrior, and more still to anyone without a racial weapon bonus. Players dismissed them as junk mail until the maths got out, and the auction price went from a few gold to well past a hundred. In Burning Crusade the weapon skills are gone, replaced by +19 hit and +17 expertise -- still excellent, no longer legendary.",proc="Equip: Reduces chance to be Dodged or Parried by 1.0%."},
