    [17192]={name="Reinforced Targe",quality=1,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Hans Weston in Armorer & Shieldsmith (Alliance) or Fela in Thunder Bluff (Horde).",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",npc="Hans Weston"},
    [17523]={name="Smokey's Drape",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent'. Starts with Smokey LaRue in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Travel to Plaguewood, northwest of Light's Hope. Destroy 8 Scourge Structures by using Smokey's Special Compound at the Mark of Detonation planted inside each building. Smokey has had the Ziggurats and Slaughterhouses marked.Once you plant the bomb, leave the building and marvel at your handiwork.By the way, Smokey's Special Compound is rather... unstable.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent",lore="While you were gathering the supplies, I had some of my people handle marking the Scourge buildings we need demolished. Here's the plan: I'm going to give you ten sticks of my special compound."},
    [17688]={name="Jungle Boots",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Green Hills of Stranglethorn'. Starts with Barnil Stonepot in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Collect the missing pages from The Green Hills of Stranglethorn manuscript. Once all four chapters are complete, return them to Barnil.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="The Green Hills of Stranglethorn",lore="Everything was going well, but a large gust of wind blew through the camp and scattered the pages everywhere! I was able to gather most of the pages but many are still strewn about the jungle."},
    [17692]={name="Horn Ring",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vorsha the Lasher'. Starts with Muglash in Ashenvale. Objective: Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.If you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Vorsha the Lasher",lore="Vorsha the Lasher... the fiendish hydra that roams the seas... She has attacked our outpost, each time unprovoked, laying waste to anything that falls in her path."},
    [17694]={name="Band of the Fist",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Allegiance to the Old Gods'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Allegiance to the Old Gods",lore="This Twilight's Hammer follower cannot be allowed to complete his plan. The Twilight's Hammer do not understand the spirits of nature. They believe in the Old Gods--creatures of chaos and destruction that were long ago defeated."},
